From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:49:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s release 7: firmware j714s12 (boot guard, speaker
 switch-over waits for the card)

Re-pinned from betizzel/omarchy-m5 101a6e6: omarchy-aurora-firmware
20261014.j714s12 (4486b6c5..., 52467 bytes) adds a pacman hook that stops
any transaction replacing or removing linux-aurora, m1n1-aurora,
uboot-aurora or omarchy-aurora-firmware with builds that are not J714s
builds (betizzel/omarchy-m5#11: an Omarchy channel switch overwrites
pacman.conf and its IgnorePkg line), and makes aurora-speaker-upgrade wait
up to 60 s for the speaker card before it runs. Nothing else changes; the
kernel pins stay at 7.3.0-17.v272-11-ARCH. Set j714s-dev-runtime-625fa91d3d01.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
